{"seq":3,"slug":"innate-knowledge","title":"Innate Knowledge","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/innate-knowledge","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"extending-liangzhi","title":"致良知","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/innate-knowledge/extending-liangzhi","wordCount":1501,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-final-teaching","title":"圣门的正法眼藏","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/innate-knowledge/the-final-teaching","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现王阳明心学的最终归宿&quot;致良知&quot;。它主张，每个人的本心都具足&quot;良知&quot;——一种本然的、能明辨善恶的道德知觉；而成圣之道，便在于将这本然的良知，推致、扩充于事事物物。王阳明自称，&quot;致良知&quot;是他历经百死千难才体悟出的&quot;圣门正法眼藏&quot;——成圣之道的根本心法。本章揭示&quot;致良知&quot;作为王阳明心学之精髓的简易而究竟的智慧。</p>\n"}